OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAny overnight rain soon
OL,6,Fclearing Buchan. Then bright or sunny
OL,7,Fintervals and a few showers, these
OL,8,Fshowers more so over Moray, with the
OL,9,Fbest of the sunshine towards Aberdeen
OL,10,Fand the east.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FThe east will be mainly dry
OL,13,Fwith clear spells this evening while a
OL,14,Ffew showers affect the west. Overnight
OL,15,Fshowers will become a little more
OL,16,Fwidespread, some heavy.
OL,17,
OL,18,CSaturday:FA cloudier day with more
OL,19,Ffrequent showers, some on the heavy
OL,20,Fside, best of the brighter spells
OL,21,Ftowards Inverbervie.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
