OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FMainly
OL,6,Fdry with sunny spells on Sunday.
OL,7,FCloudier Monday with patchy rain.
OL,8,FEarly rain clearing on Tuesday then
OL,9,Fsunshine and showers.
